Read as ints (Maybe Int), then >>= plus_one >>= currency:
  1 -> Just 1 -> Just $2.00
  99 -> Just 99 -> Just $100.00
  x -> Nothing (cannot convert 'x' to int)
  4 -> Just 4 -> Just $5.00

unit[n] >>= half >>= roman:
  3998 -> Just MCMXCIX
  7 -> Nothing (7 is odd)
  0 -> Nothing (no Roman numeral for 0)
  10000 -> Nothing (no Roman numeral for 5000)
  2024 -> Just MXII

A function after Nothing does not run (announced_half says when it runs):
  12 >>= announced_half:
    (half runs on 12)
    Just 6
  twelve >>= announced_half:
    Nothing (cannot convert 'twelve' to int)
